<title>PORTUGAL: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon upgrades Portugal banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon upgrades Portugal banks.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers has raised its price target forecasts for Portuguese banks over the next 12 months and has upgraded its buy recommendation for some banks to a 'strong buy', according to the investment bank's August share analysis.</p>
<p>     CURRENT    12-MONTH	AUGUST 97	 JUNE  97</p>
<p>PRICE(ESC) PRICE TARGET  RECOMMENDATION  RECOMMENDATION</p>
<p>BCP  3,580     4,486 (PVS 3,900)  Strong Buy	 Buy</p>
<p>BES  4,997     6,000 (PVS 4,250)  Strong Buy	 Buy</p>
<p>BPA  2,750     3,050 (PVS 3,050)	   Buy	 Buy</p>
<p>BPI  4,000     5,220 (PVS 4,700)  Strong Buy	 Strong Buy</p>
<p>BPSM 2,249     2,700 (PVS 1,450)	   Buy	 Hold</p>
<p>BTA  3,479     4,500 (PVS 3,850)  Strong Buy	 Strong Buy</p>
<p>BMC  1,485     1,700 (PVS 1,500)	   Buy	 Buy</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
